# Task Summary

The complete competition pipeline can be summarized as:

```text
3D+Time Microscopy
        │
        ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│   Cell Detection    │
│   (t, z, y, x)      │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Temporal Association│
│   Cell t → Cell t+1 │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Division Detection  │
│ Parent → Daughters  │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Tracking / Lineage  │
│       Graph         │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
     submission.csv
```

The resulting graph contains:

```text
Nodes = Cell detections
Edges = Temporal relationships
Branches = Cell divisions / lineage events
```

